# WidgetLab

WidgetLab is a modern Android widget collection designed to make your home screen more useful, customizable, and clean.

## ✨ Features

- 🎧 Earbuds battery monitoring
- 🔋 Left, Right & Case battery levels
- 🔊 ANC, Normal & Clarity controls
- 🎧 Multiple earbuds support
- 🧩 Multiple earbuds widget layouts
- 🎵 Universal media widget
- ⏮️ Previous, Play/Pause & Next controls
- 🖼️ Album artwork, song & artist information
- 🌦️ Weather widget
- 🎨 Android dynamic colors
- 🖌️ Custom widget colors
- 🌑 Adjustable background opacity
- 🔄 Automatic & manual refresh
- 📱 Modern and minimal Android UI
- 🌙 Dark-theme friendly design

## 🎧 Supported Earbuds

- Realme Buds T310
- OPPO Enco series support

## 📦 Widgets

WidgetLab currently includes:

- Earbuds — Standard
- Earbuds — Compact
- Earbuds — Visual
- Universal Media
- Weather

## 🚀 Status

This is the stable version of WidgetLab. Core earbuds, media, weather, and customization features are ready for everyday use.

More widgets, supported devices, customization options, and improvements are planned for future releases.

